<title>SPAIN: CYCLING-MINALI WINS SECOND STAGE OF TOUR OF SPAIN.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-MINALI WINS SECOND STAGE OF TOUR OF SPAIN.</headline>
<dateline>CUENCA, Spain 1996-09-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nicola Minali of Italy won the 210-km second stage of the Tour of Spain between Valencia and Cuenca on Sunday. Biagio Conte of Italy remains the overall leader.</p>
</text>
